    "note": "Cumulative ladder: rank E_n grants E_1..E_n. E1 'Ere My Death, I Stood Unmade' = while the Zone is active enemies' All-Type RES -20% (mb_e1 resAll -0.2), and the extra Skill delays the Infinite Fury countdown 15%. E2 'Ash Was My Heart, Yet the Flame Stayed' = ally Ultimates count as Follow-Up ATK (+75% FUA DMG) and the Charge cap drops to 7 (energy max 250 -> 280). E3 'Across the Shore, Wrath Laid Bare' +Ultimate Lv.2 / Talent Lv.2 raises 'Tenax Per Ignem' 3.5 -> 3.78. E4 \"Odium I've Smitten, Thence Came the Blade\" = 'Heart, Refined ad Infinitum' increases ally-target DMG +50% (mb_a2self dmgAll 0.5 -> 1). E5 'I Severed My Woes, Knowing Death Begets Life' +Skill Lv.2 / Basic Lv.1 raises Basic 'A Broken Blade Still Slays' 0.5 -> 0.55. E6 'If Immortality Could Die, I Swore THEM Slain' = as the Zone persists, +1 Charge when Mortenax Blade takes DMG/consumes HP, and 'Tenax Per Ignem' multiplier x1.5 (3.78 -> 5.67)."
  },
